    "Trailer 2 made the game feel closer even though it arrived immediately after a delay. It gave the wait substance: people to recognize, places to compare and story tensions to debate. For many fans, this was when Leonida stopped being a collection of impressive screenshots and began to feel like a world with a social structure.",
    "WHAT FANS WERE WATCHING FOR",
