    "WHAT HAPPENED",
    "For years, fake store listings and speculative price graphics had circulated around GTA VI. An official pre-order announcement removed that ambiguity by placing purchase information inside Rockstar’s own release campaign. It also created a concrete operational milestone: digital distribution would begin staging files before launch rather than asking everyone to download at the same moment.",
