    "WHY IT MATTERED",
    "The announcement strengthened confidence in the November date because it tied the calendar to platform-level logistics. It also gave the final months a new cadence: pre-order day, extended look, press coverage, preload and launch. After years when the timeline contained enormous gaps, the road to Leonida was suddenly full of scheduled checkpoints.",
    "WHAT NOT TO OVERREAD",
    "Store availability and exact unlock times can vary by region and platform. This site records Rockstar’s announced preload date and release date but does not treat fan-discovered store metadata as equivalent to official launch timing. Purchase decisions should always use the current platform listing in the player’s own region.",
